        "fileName": "WOT_Tactic_Bridge_0.2.2.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-11T19:40:20.768Z",
        "changeLog": "The download is now provided as a single WOTMOD file for easier installation. The mod displays shared WOT Tactic drawings on the standard minimap: freehand strokes, straight lines, arrows and circles. Runtime functionality is unchanged."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "0.2.3",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.2",
        "fileName": "WOT_Tactic_Bridge_0.2.3.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:44:11.085Z",
        "changeLog": "- Fixed the constant right-and-down offset of drawings relative to the standard minimap.\n- The overlay now uses the current minimap size correctly when entering battle and after the size is changed.\n- Fixed arrowheads and perpendicular end markers on freehand strokes.\n- Dashed and dotted styles now render continuously and evenly across freehand paths and circles."
      }
