        "updatedAt": "2026-08-06T14:14:52.097Z",
        "changeLog": "Version 0.0.80\nAdded tank sorting by Name, Win Rate, or Battles within each tank type.\nAdded a minimum-battles filter to reduce rental and rarely played tanks.\nAdded collapsible tank-type sections with saved preferences.\nAdded clan-logo opacity controls and optional custom high-resolution clan logos.\nPreserved scroll position when sorting or collapsing sections.\nImproved history-window controls, logo loading, scaling, and responsiveness."
      },
