        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.2",
        "fileName": "shotcaller_0.0.81.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:44:20.771Z",
        "changeLog": "Version 0.0.81\nImproved lookup recovery during temporary WG API failures.\nAdded clear Pending, Retrying, Ready, and Unavailable states.\nAdded retry countdown display without increasing API request frequency.\nHistory now refreshes automatically when recovery succeeds.\nFixed temporary failures incorrectly appearing as Missing.\nFixed lookup-status text clipping in the History window."
      }
